# Al's Hideaway — Netlify Domain Redirects
#
# PURPOSE: Make alshideaway.com redirect to staytexashillcountry.com (or vice versa)
# so both domains land on the same site.
#
# HOW TO USE THIS:
# This file handles path-based redirects. For DOMAIN-level redirects
# (alshideaway.com → staytexashillcountry.com), you must also follow
# the steps in DOMAIN-SETUP.md to configure domains in your Netlify dashboard.
#
# Once both domains are connected in Netlify and staytexashillcountry.com
# is set as the PRIMARY domain, Netlify automatically 301-redirects
# alshideaway.com to staytexashillcountry.com — no code needed.
#
# These rules below handle legacy URL redirects (old Duda/Resnexus site pages):

/travel-guide          /hill-country-guide.html     301
/event-venue           /events.html                  301
/gallery               /index.html                   301
/blog                  /hill-country-guide.html      301
/policies              /faq.html                     301
/cabins                /cabins.html                  301!
/rv                    /rv-camping.html               301
/camping               /rv-camping.html               301
/contact               /contact.html                  301
/about                 /index.html                    301
